🎹 VOICE_RECORDER

This is my web-based voice recorder project made using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Python (Flask).It lets you record, pause, resume, play, and delete audio, just like a real mobile voice recorder.I’ve also added stylish transitions, wave animations during recording, and a nice poster background to make it look modern.

🛠️ Technologies Used

Frontend: HTML, CSS (with 3D effects), JS

Backend: Python (Flask)

Storage: Saves voice files locally

✅ Features

🎤 Start, Pause/Resume, and Stop recording

📁 See all your saved voice notes

❌ Delete recordings anytime

🎵 Wave animation during recording (like mobile apps)

📱 Fully responsive design with scrolling fix

⚙️ How to Run

pip install flask
python Voice_Recorder_web.py

Then open http://127.0.0.1:5000 in your browser.

